{"ref":"BDB, בָּמוֹת","hw":"בָּמוֹת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּמוֹת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong><em>high place</em> or <em>great high place</em><strong>)</strong> place in Moab <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:19\" href=\"/Numbers.21.19\">Nu 21:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:20\" href=\"/Numbers.21.20\">20</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּמוֹת בַּעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:41\" href=\"/Numbers.22.41\">Nu 22:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:17\" href=\"/Joshua.13.17\">Jos 13:17</a> possibly on Mt. <em>‘Aṭṭarûs</em> cf. Di.","next":"BDB, בִּמְהָל","prev":"BDB, בָּמָה"}